son":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110060","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110060.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110060.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-21T20:16:34Z"},"body":"Changes the way Betsy handles RGB textures to instead convert them on the GPU and use the created texture directly (RGB formats cannot be sampled by most modern GPUs, so they need to be converted beforehand. Unfortunately, most images without an alpha channel get imported as RGB).\r\n\r\nThis was achieved by taking the input data as an SSBO and writing the output to an image.\r\nThis improves the compression times by about ~2x in most cases.\r\n\r\nPerformance:\r\n| Image | Before | After |\r\n|--------|---------|-------|\r\n| 4K RGB8 (DXT1) | 74 ms | 34 ms |\r\n| 4K RGB8 (RGTC_RG) | 75 ms | 35 ms |\r\n| 4K RGB8 (RGTC_R) | 69 ms | 30 ms |\r\n| 4Kx2K RGBF (BPTC_RGBFU) | 147 ms | 73 ms |\r\n| 4Kx2K RGBH (BPTC_RGBFU) | 82 ms | 50 ms |\r\n\r\n#110901 could pave the way for further improvements by avoiding instances of `memcpy()`.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Measure the performance difference,\r\n- [x] Ensure the textures look exactly the same as the CPU version,\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110060/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110060/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}